    "title": "J-Curve earns innovation-growth venture certification",
    "excerpt": "J-Curve earns venture certification and prepares ShopiTrend, a shopping-market competitor analysis solution.",
    "content": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><img src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/manager/data/editor/2208/7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\" title=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\" alt=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\"><br style=\"clear:both;\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">Hello, J-Curve Interactive has good news<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"> J-Curve has earned innovation-growth venture company certification<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"> This Korean certification is awarded, among the country's <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">6.9</span> million SMEs, only to the selected <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">0.6%</span>of companies<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"> It requires assessment across <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">14</span> areas and a rigorous review<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">. </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">We met the requirements, comprehensively revised in <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">2021</span>, for venture-company selection and received recognition for <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>innovation<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’</span>and <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>business viability<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’ </span>as well as <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>a stable financial structure<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’</span>as the basis for growth potential<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/manager/data/editor/2208/7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\" title=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\" alt=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\"> We are preparing to launch our shopping-market competitor analysis solution, </span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">ShopiTrend</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">, soon</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"> ShopiTrend covers shopping data from market analysis and revenue forecasts to which competitor product options sell well<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"> Starting with this certification, we will build on years of marketing experience</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-size:10pt;\">,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"> and work to offer keyword analysis, extraction and other solutions through tailored <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">ShopiTrend services<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">! </span>Thank you <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">:)</span></p>",
    "meta_title": "J-Curve earns innovation-growth venture certification",
    "meta_description": "J-Curve earns venture certification and prepares ShopiTrend, a shopping-market competitor analysis solution."
  },
  "ja": {
    "slug": "jcurve-earns-innovation-growth-venture-company-certification",
    "title": "革新成長型ベンチャー企業認証を取得",
    "excerpt": "ベンチャー企業認証を取得し、EC市場の競合分析ソリューションShopiTrendの公開を準備しています。",
    "content": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><img src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/manager/data/editor/2208/7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\" title=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\" alt=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812614_1942.png\"><br style=\"clear:both;\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">こんにちは。J-Curve Interactiveからうれしいお知らせです<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">革新成長型ベンチャー企業認証を取得しました<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">韓国の中小企業 <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">690</span>万社のうち <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">0.6%</span>という少数の企業だけに与えられる認証です<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">計 <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">14</span>分野の総合評価と厳しい審査を通過する必要があります<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">. </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">当社は <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">2021</span>年に全面改定された厳しい条件を満たし、 <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>革新性<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’</span>と <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>事業性<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’ </span>そして <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">‘</span>安定した財務構造<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">’</span>に基づく成長性を認められました<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/manager/data/editor/2208/7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\" title=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\" alt=\"7707a5dabb6722430529904533bac317_1660812629_5447.jpg\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">現在、ショッピング市場の競合分析ソリューション </span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">ShopiTrend（ショピトレンド）</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">の公開を準備しています</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-family:'맑은 고딕';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;\">.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">市場分析、収益予測、競合の売れ筋オプションなど、ECに関するデータを確認できます<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">今回の認証を出発点に、長年の経験をさらに伸ばし</span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\" style=\"font-size:10pt;\">,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">今後のShopiTrendでも個別サービスを通じ、キーワード分析や抽出などの各種施策を <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:10pt;font-family:'맑은 고딕';\">提供できるよう努めます<span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">! </span>ありがとうございます <span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">:)</span></p>",
    "meta_title": "革新成長型ベンチャー企業認証を取得",
    "meta_description": "ベンチャー企業認証を取得し、EC市場の競合分析ソリューションShopiTrendの公開を準備しています。"
  }
